  "title": "Saving as Text (JSON)",
  "story": "Browsers store data as text. JSON turns lists and objects into text and back. (On a real site you would pass this text to localStorage.)",
  "goal": "Define toText(list) that returns the JSON text of a list, and fromText(text) that returns the list back, or [] when the text is empty or not valid JSON.",
  "type": "web",
